                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. はい。初心者の方が多数ご参加いただいています。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "3ebc7da6-963c-5c78-9e2b-77b2f6ed01f6",
            "x": 630,
            "y": 148.1,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 119,
            "order": 3,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 何を持っていけばいいですか？"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. 動きやすい服装、運動靴、タオル、飲み物をお持ちください。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "3ca2c87f-2f64-51d6-9cfa-eb111e6bb89a",
            "x": 50,
            "y": 296.884,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 87,
            "order": 4,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 男性も参加できますか？"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. はい、男性の会員様も歓迎です。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "4df777e9-13e1-500f-8d47-449fb95b502a",
            "x": 630,
            "y": 296.884,
            "width": 520,
            "height": 87,
            "order": 5,
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": 3,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Q. 途中参加はできますか？"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "block",
                "paragraphSize": 0.4,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "A. いつからでも参加できます。",
                    "fontSize": 18
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
